<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Oct 16 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Oct 16 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED OCTOBER 16</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............768,600 up.....4,100</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...702,700 up.....1,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......462,300 up.....3,600</p>
<p> ONE WEEK ENDED OCTOBER 16</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....755,863 down ..3,388</p>
<p> Financial companies.......565,251 down ..3,125</p>
<p> New York business loans....41,519 down ....911</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......41,274 down ....894</p>
</text>
